1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,780
In a sunlit workshop a young potter sits at her wheel ready
to create something beautiful.

2
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:10,769
She centers a lump of clay on the spinning wheel with
careful steady hands.

3
00:00:10,769 --> 00:00:16,440
With gentle pressure from her fingers she begins to shape
the clay into a graceful form.

4
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:21,589
She opens the clay with her thumbs creating space for the
vessel to take shape.

5
00:00:21,589 --> 00:00:27,039
Pulling and shaping with rhythmic motions she builds the
walls higher and more elegant.

6
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:32,219
Finally she adds delicate decorative patterns with careful
carving tools.
